            "text": "<p>A shank is not a hook. It is the backbone for articulated streamers and steelhead Intruders. Our house shanks are what we size for Columbia and coast-style builds.</p><p>Pick length and wire for the pattern. Evergreen 2-for-1, when live, is not Labor Day.</p>"
