          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What\u2019s the difference between a shank and a hook?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>A hook has a point and bend. A shank is wire for articulated bodies, usually with a trailing hook.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which flies use shanks?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Steelhead Intruders, articulated streamers, multi-section baitfish patterns.</p>"
